Ember
======

This product bundles two components:

1. Ember-miner client (the Python code under client/) — MIT licensed.
   See LICENSE.

2. btx-gbt-solve solver (bin/btx-gbt-solve) — a proprietary binary built from
   the MIT-licensed BTX / Bitcoin Core source with Ember's own HIP/ROCm
   backend and optimizations. The binary is distributed under the terms in
   TERMS.md (you may use it to mine; you may not redistribute or modify it).
   As required by the MIT license of the upstream code it is built from, that
   license text is reproduced below.

